      <VERS vnumber="5"> He <gr str="157">loveth </gr>
        <gr str="6666">righteousness </gr>and <gr str="4941">judgment</gr>: the <gr str="776">earth </gr>is <gr str="4390">full </gr>of the <gr str="2617">goodness </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6"> By the <gr str="1697">word </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>were the <gr str="8064">heavens </gr>
