      <VERS vnumber="7"> He <gr str="3664">gathereth </gr>the <gr str="4325">waters </gr>of the <gr str="3220">sea </gr>together as a <gr str="5067">heap</gr>: he layeth <gr str="5414">up </gr>the <gr str="8415">depth </gr>in <gr str="214">storehouses</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8"> Let <gr str="3605">all </gr>the <gr str="776">earth </gr>
