      <VERS vnumber="10"> The <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>bringeth the <gr str="6098">counsel </gr>of the <gr str="1471">heathen </gr>to <gr str="6331">naught</gr>: he maketh the <gr str="4284">devices </gr>of the <gr str="5971">people </gr>of none <gr str="5106">effect</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11"> The <gr str="6098">counsel </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
        <gr str="5975">standeth </gr>
