      <VERS vnumber="19"> To <gr str="5337">deliver </gr>their <gr str="5315">soul </gr>from <gr str="4480 4194">death</gr>, and to keep them <gr str="2421">alive </gr>in <gr str="7458">famine</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20"> Our <gr str="5315">soul </gr>
